{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17497","headline":"自桐庐如兰溪有寄 · 权德舆","name":"自桐庐如兰溪有寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东南江路旧知名，惆怅春深又独行。\n新妇山头云半敛，女儿滩上月初明。\n风前荡扬双飞蝶，花里间关百啭莺。\n满目归心何处说，欹眠搔首不胜情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17497.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17497","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}